<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>CONTAINERS.</p>
<p>Alina I - (built 1985) 4,250 dwt plus sistership Lirena - (built 1986) 4,250 dwt sold for $10 million enbloc.</p>
<p>DSR-Senator - (built 1977) 24,815 dwt and Woermann Expert (built 1977) 21,181 dwt sold for $14.5 million enbloc, with three year timecharter back.</p>
<p>RO-RO'S.</p>
<p>Helene - (built 1985) 7,130 dwt sold to for $7.1 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions.</p>
